problem:
Solve the system of equations:
\[
\begin{cases}
(x^3 + y^3)\left(1 + \frac{1}{xy}\right)^3 = \frac{125}{4} \\
(x^2 + y^2)\left(1 + \frac{1}{xy}\right)^2 = \frac{25}{2}
\end{cases}
\]

Compute the inverse of the matrix \( B \in M_n(\mathbb{R}) \) where:
\[ b(i,j) = \begin{cases} 
1 & \text{if } i \leq j \\
0 & \text{otherwise}
\end{cases} \]

Solve the system of equations:
\[
\begin{cases}
2x^2 + xy = 1 \\
\frac{9x^2}{2(1-x)^4} = 1 + \frac{3xy}{2(1-x)^2}
\end{cases}
\]
